# TextPad client — environment variables template
# Copy to .env for local development, or set in the Vercel project settings
# (Settings → Environment Variables) for production/preview builds.

# Base URL of the backend API (Render). Leave EMPTY in development to use the
# Vite proxy (/api → localhost:3001). For production/preview against a
# deployed server, set it explicitly, e.g.:
VITE_API_URL=https://your-app.onrender.com
